        <mxCell id="notes" value="&lt;b&gt;NOTES&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 12px;&quot;&gt;1.&amp;nbsp; Arrows show the direction of each call; responses return along the same path.&lt;br&gt;2.&amp;nbsp; Map tiles are requested &lt;b&gt;directly by the client applications&lt;/b&gt; and do not pass through the Express API.&lt;br&gt;3.&amp;nbsp; Role-based access control is enforced at the Application Layer, not in either client.&lt;br&gt;4.&amp;nbsp; Dashed boxes are external services reached over HTTPS.&lt;/font&gt;" style="rounded=0;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;fillColor=#FFFFFF;strokeColor=#9E9E9E;dashed=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;spacingLeft=10;spacingTop=6;spacingRight=8;fontSize=13;" vertex="1" parent="1">
